{"metadata": {"file_suffix": "pdf", "producer": {"name": "mineru", "version": "4.0.12"}, "document": {"created_at": "2020-03-18T16:42:07+08:00", "modified_at": "2024-03-26T09:34:02+08:00", "producer_application": "PDFlib Personalization Server 8.0.2 (C++/Win32)", "page_count": 232, "page_count_kind": "physical"}}, "extensions": {"mineru": {"tier": "standard", "parse_mode": "ocr"}, "docvortex_layout": {"version": 1, "pages": [{"page_idx": 200, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 201, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 202, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 203, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 204, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 205, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 206, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 207, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 208, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 209, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 210, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 211, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 212, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 213, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 214, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 215, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 216, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 217, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 218, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 219, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 220, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 221, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 222, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 223, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 224, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 225, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 226, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 227, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 228, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 229, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 230, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2952.0}, {"page_idx": 231, "width_pt": 1984.0, "height_pt": 2944.0}]}}, "pages": [{"page_idx": 200, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.083, 0.057, 0.12, 0.07], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "188"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.403, 0.055, 0.564, 0.071], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.048, 0.091, 0.918, 0.192], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "于这些计算模型来研究算法。为避免这些不同模型对运行时间的影响,人们假设每做一次初等运算(算术运算、比较和转移等最基本的操作)均需要一个单位时间,由此用算法在执行过程中总共所需要的初等运算数来表示算法用于求解任一问题的某一例子时所需要的时间。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.049, 0.201, 0.919, 0.275], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "其次,为了恰当描述不同例子之间的差别和算法的运行时间随例子的不同而发生变化的方式,人们引进了问题例子规模(size)的概念。所谓一个问题例子的规模是指为描述或表示它而需要的信息量。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.05, 0.283, 0.919, 0.33], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "有了上面的准备,现在可以给出一个算法的时间复杂性函数(time complexity function)的定义,它是问题例子输入长度的函数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.051, 0.347, 0.921, 0.392], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.2 如果某一问题 II 的规模是 n，解决问题 II 的某一算法所需的时间为关于 n 的函数  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "T(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，称  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "T(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  为该算法的时间复杂性。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.051, 0.401, 0.921, 0.585], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "类似地,可以定义算法的空间复杂性。对于不同的算法,就有不同的时间复杂性函数。复杂性函数的不同变化方式反应了算法的好坏程度。时间复杂性函数关于问题规模的增长速度就是判别一个算法实际效率的主要指标。那么,什么样的时间复杂性函数所对应的算法是好的、可以接受的呢?现今,在计算科学中存在这样一个一般的约定:仅当算法的时间复杂性函数随着问题例子规模的增加而多项式地增长时,才认为这个算法是实用的、有效的。按照这种观点,则可以将算法分为多项式时间算法和指数时间算法两大类。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.052, 0.594, 0.921, 0.64], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "在给出两类算法的定义之前,先系统地介绍在表示算法复杂性时常用的几个渐近记号的定义。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.053, 0.656, 0.921, 0.732], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.3 ☑记号: 对一个给定的函数, 用 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Theta(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 来表示如下特定函数的集合: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Theta(g(n)) = \\{f(n): 存在正常数 c_1, c_2, n_0\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 使对所有的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\geqslant n_0"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "0 \\leqslant c_1 g(n) \\leqslant f(n) \\leqslant c_2 g(n)\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.052, 0.742, 0.921, 0.844], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "对任意函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 若存在正常数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_{1}, c_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 使当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 充分大时, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 取值在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_{1}g(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_{2}g(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 之间, 则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 属于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Theta(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 集合。因为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Theta(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个集合, 可以写成“"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n) \\in \\Theta(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": "”, 但通常写成“"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n) = \\Theta(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。这样写的好处在于带渐进记号的公式进行计算时, 写起来较为方便。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.054, 0.853, 0.921, 0.899], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果对所有的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\geqslant n_{0}, f(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 在一个常数因子范围内与 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "g(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 相等, 那么就说 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "g(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的渐进确界。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.099, 0.909, 0.922, 0.926], "content": [{"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Theta(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的定义要求每个成员 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n) \\in \\Theta(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 都是渐进非负，也就是说当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 足够大"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 201, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.376, 0.061, 0.595, 0.075], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第5章 计算复杂性基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.85, 0.062, 0.885, 0.075], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "189"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.054, 0.095, 0.91, 0.113], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "时， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  是非负值。这就要求  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "g(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  本身也是渐进非负的，否则集合  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Theta(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  就是空集。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.097, 0.129, 0.435, 0.147], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例5.2 证明: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2n^{2} - 3n = \\Theta (n^{2})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.097, 0.165, 0.72, 0.183], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 首先需要确定常数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_{1}, c_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n_{0}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，使得对于所有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\geqslant n_{0}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.367, 0.192, 0.604, 0.211], "content": "c _ {1} n ^ {2} \\leqslant 2 n ^ {2} - 3 n \\leqslant c _ {2} n ^ {2}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.054, 0.22, 0.354, 0.238], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "成立。用 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n^2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 除上述不等式得"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.398, 0.249, 0.573, 0.28], "content": "c _ {1} \\leqslant 2 - \\frac {3}{n} \\leqslant c _ {2}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.054, 0.291, 0.921, 0.365], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "式中，右边的不等式在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_{2} \\geqslant 2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时对所有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\geqslant 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 成立。同样，左边的不等式可以让 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_{1} \\leqslant 1 / 2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 对所有的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\geqslant 2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 成立。这样，通过选择 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_{1} = 1 / 2, c_{2} = 2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，以及 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\geqslant 2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，得到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n^{2} - 3n = \\Theta(n^{2})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的证明。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.054, 0.376, 0.921, 0.48], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "还可以使用正式定义来证明 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\frac{1}{3} n^3 \\neq \\Theta(n^2)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。为引出矛盾，假设存在常数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n_0"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，使得所有的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\geqslant n_0"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，均有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\frac{1}{3} n^3 \\leqslant c_2 n^2"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，这样就有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\leqslant 3c_2"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，这对任意大的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是不可能的，因为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是常数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.054, 0.489, 0.924, 0.645], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "从直观上看,一个渐进正函数中的低阶项在决定渐进确界时可以被忽略,因为当 n 很大时它就相对不重要了。最高阶项很小的一部分就足以超越所有的低阶项。因此,若将 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 置成略小于最高阶项系数的值,而将 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 置成稍大于最高阶项系数的值,就可以满足 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Theta"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 记号定义中的不等式。同样,最高阶项的系数也可以忽略,因为它只是将 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 改变成等于该系数的常数。因为任意一个常数都是 0 次多项式,故可以把任何常数表示成 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Theta (n^{0})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 或 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Theta (1)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.099, 0.66, 0.832, 0.678], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.4 O 记号: 对一个函数  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "g(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，用  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  表示如下特定函数集合:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.099, 0.688, 0.9, 0.706], "content": [{"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(g(n))=\\{f(n):存在正常数c,n_{0},使对所有的n\\geqslant n_{0},有0\\leqslant f(n)\\leqslant cg(n)\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.056, 0.715, 0.924, 0.815], "content": [{"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 记号在一个常数因子内给出某函数的一个上界。记 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n) = O(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 表示一个函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是集合 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的一个元素, 注意到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n) = \\Theta(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 隐含着 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n) = O(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 因为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Theta"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 记号强于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 记号, 所以有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Theta(g(n)) \\subseteq O(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。例如, 容易证明任意一个线性函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "an + b = O(n^{2})"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 但是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "an + b"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 不在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Theta(n^{2})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.1, 0.831, 0.857, 0.849], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.5 Ω 记号: 给定一个函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "g\\left( n\\right)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,用 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Omega \\left( {g\\left( n\\right) }\\right)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 表示如下特定函数集合:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.102, 0.859, 0.859, 0.877], "content": [{"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Omega (g(n)) = \\{f(n):"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 存在正常数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c,n_0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，使对所有的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n\\geqslant n_0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n)\\geqslant cg(n)\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.057, 0.886, 0.924, 0.932], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "正如 O 记号给出一个函数的渐进上界,  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Omega"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  号给出函数的渐进下界, 容易证明下面重要的定理。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 202, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.087, 0.056, 0.123, 0.069], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "190"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.407, 0.055, 0.568, 0.07], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.051, 0.09, 0.919, 0.136], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 5.1 对任意两个函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "g(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n) = \\Theta(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 当且仅当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n) = O(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n) = \\Omega(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.053, 0.144, 0.921, 0.191], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "作为应用本定理的一个例子,证明  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "an^{3}+bn=\\Theta(n^{3})"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  (其中 a,b,c 为常数且 a>0) 就立即能得出  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "an^{3}+bn=O(n^{3})"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  和  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "an^{3}+bn=\\Omega(n^{3})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.051, 0.2, 0.921, 0.275], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "渐进记号也可以用于一个等式中略去无关紧要的细节。例如, 公式 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2n^{2} + 3n + 1 = 2n^{2} + \\Theta(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 即表示 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2n^{2} + 3n + 1 = 2n^{2} + f(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 其中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是某个属于集合 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Theta(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的函数。在本例中, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n) = 3n + 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Theta(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.097, 0.292, 0.82, 0.309], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.6 o 记号: 对一个函数  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "g(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，用  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "o(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  表示如下特定函数集合:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.053, 0.319, 0.921, 0.365], "content": [{"type": "equation_inline", "content": "o(g(n)) = \\{f(n): \\text{对任意正常数 } c, \\text{ 存在 } n_0, \\text{ 使对所有的 } n \\geqslant n_0, \\text{ 有 } 0 \\leqslant f(n) \\leqslant cg(n)\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.052, 0.374, 0.924, 0.503], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "一般使用 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "o"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 记号来表示非渐进紧确的上界。"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 记号所提供的渐进上界可能是也可能不是渐进紧确的。"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2n^{2} = O(n^{2})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是渐进紧确的，但 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2n = O(n^{2})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 却不是。其主要区别在于对 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 记号，"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "0 \\leqslant f(n) \\leqslant cg(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 对某个常数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 成立；但对 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "o"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 记号，"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "0 \\leqslant f(n) \\leqslant cg(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 对所有常数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c > 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 成立。从直觉上看，在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "o"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 表示中，当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 趋于无穷时，函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 相对于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "g(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 来说就不重要了，即"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.415, 0.513, 0.557, 0.547], "content": "\\lim _ {n \\to \\infty} \\frac {f (n)}{g (n)} = 0"}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.098, 0.564, 0.766, 0.581], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.7  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\omega"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  记号:  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\omega"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  记号用来表示非渐进紧确的下界, 它的定义为:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.098, 0.591, 0.913, 0.609], "content": [{"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\omega (g(n)) = \\{f(n):"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 对任意正常数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，存在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n_0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，使对所有的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n\\geqslant n_0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n)\\geqslant cg(n)\\}"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.098, 0.627, 0.84, 0.645], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 5.3 容易验证 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n^{2} = \\omega(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 但 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2n \\neq \\omega(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 关系 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n) = \\omega(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 意味着"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.415, 0.657, 0.562, 0.69], "content": "\\lim _ {n \\to \\infty} \\frac {f (n)}{g (n)} = \\infty"}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.054, 0.707, 0.923, 0.781], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.8 多项式时间算法 (polynomial time algorithm) 是指时间复杂性函数是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(p(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的算法, 这里 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是关于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的多项式。不能够这样限制时间复杂度的算法被称为指数时间算法。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.055, 0.797, 0.922, 0.844], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 5.4 时间复杂度为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(n \\log(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 、 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(n^{3})"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的算法都是多项式时间算法，时间复杂度为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(n^{\\log(n)})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(n!)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(2^{n})"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的算法都是指数时间算法。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.054, 0.853, 0.924, 0.927], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "为了便于读者对这两类算法有一个直观上的了解,现考虑一台 PC 一天能解决例子的规模。对于立方级别复杂度的算法,即 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(n^{3})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的算法,这个规模大约是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "10^{4}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "; 对于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(2^{n})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的算法,规模大约是 40; 而对于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(n!)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的算法,其规模为 14。考虑这台 PC 因为"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 203, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.382, 0.059, 0.602, 0.075], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第5章 计算复杂性基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.855, 0.061, 0.892, 0.075], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "191"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.057, 0.094, 0.928, 0.25], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "硬件更新换代,速度较之前提升了200倍,则此时这三种算法能解决的规模分别是6×10^4,48,16。可见,指数时间复杂性函数的增长速度要比多项式时间复杂性函数的增长速度快得多(解决问题的规模小得多)。因此,随着问题例子规模的不断增大,任意一个多项式时间算法终归比任一个指数时间算法更有效。另外,多项式时间算法有一个较好的“封闭”性质,即几个多项式时间算法可以被复合为一个多项式时间算法。调用另一多项式时间算法作为其子算法或子程序,其最后的结果仍是一个多项式时间算法。"}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.056, 0.257, 0.93, 0.523], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "由于上述原因,多项式时间算法要比指数时间算法好得多,这是人们常常更加希望得到的。而一个算法是多项式时间算法还是指数时间算法等,本质上并不依赖于特定的编码策略和具体的计算模型。原因是,这些定义、划分相对于多项式变换具有不变性,而由不同的合理编码策略所给出的某个问题同一例子的描述,其相应的输入长度(或长度的下界和上界)之间最多相差一个多项式的倍数,且易于从一种编码转化到或导出另一种编码。类似地,对任何合理的计算模型,这里“合理的”是指可用一个多项式来界定计算模型做单一时间单位内所能完成的工作量,它们相对于多项式的复杂性函数均是等价的。所有现实中的计算模型,包括各类图灵机和随机存取机等,均为合理的计算模型。下面将介绍计算复杂性的两个基础计算模型;确定性图灵机、RAM模型和非确定性图灵机。通过这些模型,读者将对算法、NP-完全性等有一个直观的认识。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.058, 0.556, 0.45, 0.579], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5.2 确定图灵机与 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 类问题"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.057, 0.615, 0.931, 0.771], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "计算模型在算法理论研究中具有重要的地位,20世纪中叶之前,人们设计了各种各样的计算模型,其中最有代表性的是英国著名数学家阿兰图灵于1936年提出的一种计算模型——图灵机,该模型由一个控制器、一条可无限延伸的带子和一个在带子上左右移动的读/写头组成。这个在概念上如此简单的机器,理论上却可以计算任何直观可计算的函数。图灵机作为计算机的理论模型,在有关计算理论和计算复杂性的研究方面得到了广泛的应用。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.057, 0.778, 0.931, 0.907], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "一个确定性 k 带图灵机(Deterministic k-tape Turing Machine, DTM), 常称为确定性图灵机, 是由一个有限状态控制器和 k 条具有无限多个带格的线性带所组成。每条线性带都有一个与有限状态控制器相连的带头, 其示意图如图 5.1 所示, 它具有几个基本操作: 读/写头可以从带格中读取信息, 也可以写入信息或存储信息及清除信息, 读/写头还可以左移一格、右移一格或者停在当前方格不动, 计算终止时停机。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 204, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.087, 0.055, 0.124, 0.068], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "192"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.406, 0.053, 0.568, 0.069], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "image", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.25, 0.095, 0.72, 0.354], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.25, 0.095, 0.72, 0.354], "content": ""}, {"type": "image_caption", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.36, 0.362, 0.617, 0.379], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "图5.1 确定性图灵机示意图"}]}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.054, 0.395, 0.925, 0.577], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "一个确定性 k 带图灵机程序(Program)可以详细描述为一个七元组: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "TM=(Q,T,I,b,\\delta,q_{0},q_{f})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，其中，Q 是一个有限状态集合； "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q_{0}\\in Q"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  称为初始状态； "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q_{f}\\in Q"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  称为终止状态或接收状态。T 是带格中符号的有限集合；I 是输入字符集，且  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "I\\subset T"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ；b 是 T 中的唯一空符，有  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b\\in T-I"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ； "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\delta"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  称做图灵机的下移函数或有限状态控制函数，是从  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Q\\times T^{k}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的某一个子集到  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Q\\times(T\\times\\{L,R,S\\})^{k}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的映射函数，即对于由一个当前状态和 k 条带上扫描到的当前符号所构成的一个  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k+1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  元组，它唯一地给出一个新的状态和 k 个序偶，而每一个序偶由一个新的带符号和带头移动方向组成。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.099, 0.584, 0.58, 0.602], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "假定某台图灵机的下移函数表中有一个定义式为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.202, 0.609, 0.778, 0.63], "content": "\\delta (q, a _ {1}, a _ {2}, \\dots , a _ {k}) = [ q ^ {\\prime}, (a _ {1} ^ {\\prime}, d _ {1}), (a _ {2} ^ {\\prime}, d _ {2}), \\dots , (a _ {k} ^ {\\prime}, d _ {k}) ]"}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.057, 0.638, 0.924, 0.684], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "当图灵机处于状态 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 且对一切 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1 \\leqslant i \\leqslant k"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 第 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "i"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 条带的带头扫描着的当前方格中的符号正好是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{i}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时, 图灵机就按这个下移函数定义式所规定的内容进行如下工作:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.101, 0.692, 0.864, 0.711], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) 把第 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "i"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 条带头下当前方格中的符号 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{i}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 清除并写上新的带符号 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{i}^{\\prime}, 1 \\leqslant i \\leqslant k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.057, 0.719, 0.924, 0.764], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 按 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "d_{i}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 指出的方向移动各带的带头。这里, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "d_{i} = L"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 表示带头往左移一格, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "d_{i} = R"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 表示带头往右移一格, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "d_{i} = S"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 表示带头不动。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.082, 0.772, 0.453, 0.791], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "（3）将图灵机的当前状态 q 改为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.057, 0.799, 0.926, 0.873], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "这样,图灵机就完成了计算的一个步骤。一台图灵机的全部工作是从初始状态 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q_{0}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 开始,按下移函数一步一步进行计算。如果通过若干步骤计算后,机器状态变成终止状态,图灵机就自动停止工作;如果没有出现终止状态,它就不会停机。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.057, 0.88, 0.928, 0.927], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "一台图灵机可以用来识别一个语言。这样一台图灵机的带符号集 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "T"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 应当包括这个语言的字母表中的全体符号和一个空白符 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b"}, {"type": "text", "content": " (有时还有其他符号)。开始, 第一条带上放有一"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 205, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.375, 0.059, 0.595, 0.074], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第 5 章 计算复杂性基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.849, 0.061, 0.885, 0.074], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "193"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.051, 0.093, 0.921, 0.199], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "个输入符号串(从最左的方格起每格放一个输入字符),这条带的其余方格都是空白。其他各带上的方格也全是空白。所有的带头都处在各带左端的第一个方格上。当且仅当图灵机从指定的初始状态 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q_{0}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 出发,经过一系列计算步骤后,最终进入终止状态(或接收状态) "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q_{f}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时,称图灵机接收这个输入符号串。"}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.052, 0.213, 0.92, 0.26], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.9 被这台图灵机所接收的所有输入符号串的集合,称做这台图灵机识别的一个语言。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.052, 0.274, 0.92, 0.321], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 5.5 设有一台能识别字母表 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Sigma = \\{0,1\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 上所有正反读相同的字的二带图灵机, 当输入符号串为 10101 时, 它的工作过程如下:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.053, 0.329, 0.921, 0.378], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) 当带 1 上有输入字符串 10101, 带 2 上全是空白符, 两个带头都扫描着 (读) 各带左边的第一方格时, 机器状态为初始状态 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q_{0}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.053, 0.385, 0.921, 0.431], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 在带 2 的第一方格中写入特殊符号 ×，且把带 1 上的这个符号串写到带 2 上，控制状态改为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.098, 0.439, 0.665, 0.458], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(3) 把带 2 的带头移到左边第一方格上, 控制状态改为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "{q}_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.054, 0.465, 0.921, 0.515], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(4) 当带头 2 读到当前符号不是空白符 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时, 带头 2 向右移动一格, 带头 1 向左移动一格, 转入状态 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "{q}_{3}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ; 否则, 进入接收状态 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "{q}_{5}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 停机。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.053, 0.522, 0.922, 0.569], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(5) 判断两个带头下读到的符号是否相同。如果相同, 重复 (4); 否则, 进入不接收状态且停机。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.054, 0.579, 0.923, 0.682], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "图灵机的(4)和(5)的工作过程,也就是控制状态 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q_{3}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 开始以后的转换过程没有画出来。但表5.1给出了这台图灵机的全部下移函数。从表5.1可以看出,这台图灵机对于字母表 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\{0,1\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 上的任何长度的正反读相同的字符串,它都会进入接收状态 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q_{5}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,而对任何正反读不同的字符串,图灵机不可能进入接收状态,因而一概不接收。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.054, 0.689, 0.923, 0.735], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "用类似表 5.1 的形式给出图灵机的全部下移函数的好处是直观、清晰,但是当图灵机很复杂时,表格会非常庞大。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.054, 0.743, 0.922, 0.791], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "就像写程序一样,也可以直接给出 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\delta"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 函数。"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\delta"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 函数的任何部分集构成一段图灵机程序。对于表 5.1 定义的图灵机,给出的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\delta"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 函数如下所述。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.054, 0.8, 0.923, 0.847], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "若输入不为空,则在带2上的第一方格写入符号×,带头2右移一格,进入状态 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,否则,进入状态 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q_{5}"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.323, 0.855, 0.653, 0.877], "content": "\\delta (q _ {0}, 0, b) = [ q _ {1}, (0, S), (\\times , R) ]"}, {"type": "equation", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.324, 0.882, 0.652, 0.903], "content": "\\delta (q _ {0}, 1, b) = [ q _ {1}, (1, S), (\\times , R) ]"}, {"type": "equation", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.328, 0.909, 0.648, 0.93], "content": "\\delta (q _ {0}, b, b) = [ q _ {5}, (b, S), (b, S) ]"}]}, {"page_idx": 206, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.099, 0.055, 0.136, 0.068], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "194"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.419, 0.053, 0.581, 0.069], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.069, 0.107, 0.931, 0.628], "content": [{"type": "table_caption", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.213, 0.089, 0.785, 0.105], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "表 5.1 识别字母表 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\{ 0,1\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 上正反读相同的串的双带图灵机下移函数"}]}, {"type": "table_body", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.069, 0.107, 0.931, 0.628], "content": "<table><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">当前状态</td><td colspan=\"2\">带头扫描着的符号</td><td colspan=\"2\">新的带符号和带头移动方向</td><td rowspan=\"2\">新的状态</td><td rowspan=\"2\">说明</td></tr><tr><td>带1</td><td>带2</td><td>带1</td><td>带2</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><eq>q_0</eq></td><td>0</td><td>b</td><td>0,S</td><td>×,R</td><td><eq>q_1</eq></td><td rowspan=\"3\">若输入非空,则在带2的第一方格写入符号×,带头2右移一格,进入状态<eq>q_1</eq>;否则进入状态<eq>q_5</eq></td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>b</td><td>1,S</td><td>×,R</td><td><eq>q_1</eq></td></tr><tr><td>b</td><td>b</td><td>b,S</td><td>b,S</td><td><eq>q_5</eq></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><eq>q_1</eq></td><td>0</td><td>b</td><td>0,R</td><td>0,R</td><td><eq>q_1</eq></td><td rowspan=\"3\">将带1的符号依次往带2上复制,状态<eq>q_1</eq>不变。直到带头1读到符号b,才进入状态<eq>q_2</eq></td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>b</td><td>1,R</td><td>1,R</td><td><eq>q_1</eq></td></tr><tr><td>b</td><td>b</td><td>b,S</td><td>b,L</td><td><eq>q_2</eq></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><eq>q_2</eq></td><td>b</td><td>0</td><td>b,S</td><td>0,L</td><td><eq>q_2</eq></td><td rowspan=\"3\">带头1不动,将带头2逐次向左移动,直到读到符号×才脱离状态<eq>q_2</eq>,进入状态<eq>q_3</eq></td></tr><tr><td>b</td><td>1</td><td>b,S</td><td>1,L</td><td><eq>q_2</eq></td></tr><tr><td>b</td><td>×</td><td>b,L</td><td>×,R</td><td><eq>q_3</eq></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><eq>q_3</eq></td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0,S</td><td>0,R</td><td><eq>q_4</eq></td><td rowspan=\"2\">当两个带头读到的符号相同时,带头2向右移一格,进入状态<eq>q_4</eq></td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>1,S</td><td>1,R</td><td><eq>q_4</eq></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"6\"><eq>q_4</eq></td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0,L</td><td>0,S</td><td><eq>q_3</eq></td><td rowspan=\"6\">如果带头2读到符号b,则进入状态<eq>q_5</eq>;否则,带头1左移一格,返回状态<eq>q_3</eq>,继续往下依次比较。交替使用<eq>q_3</eq>和<eq>q_4</eq>是防止带头1从左端掉下</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>0,L</td><td>1,S</td><td><eq>q_3</eq></td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>1,L</td><td>0,S</td><td><eq>q_3</eq></td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>1,L</td><td>1,S</td><td><eq>q_3</eq></td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>b</td><td>0,S</td><td>b,S</td><td><eq>q_5</eq></td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>b</td><td>1,S</td><td>b,S</td><td><eq>q_5</eq></td></tr><tr><td><eq>q_5</eq></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>接收</td></tr></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.068, 0.646, 0.936, 0.695], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "将带 1 的符号依次往带 2 上复制, 状态 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 不变。直到带头 1 读到符号 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 进入状态 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 即"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.338, 0.704, 0.666, 0.782], "content": "\\begin{array}{r l} \\delta (q _ {1}, 0, b) & = [ q _ {1}, (0, R), (0, R) ] \\\\ \\delta (q _ {1}, 1, b) & = [ q _ {1}, (1, R), (1, R) ] \\\\ \\delta (q _ {1}, b, b) & = [ q _ {2}, (b, S), (b, L) ] \\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.113, 0.792, 0.933, 0.811], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "带头 1 不动, 将带头 2 逐次向左移动, 并保持状态不变, 直到读到符号 ×, 进入状态 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "{q}_{3}"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.334, 0.819, 0.673, 0.897], "content": "\\begin{array}{r l} \\delta (q _ {2}, b, 1) & = [ q _ {2}, (b, S), (1, L) ] \\\\ \\delta (q _ {2}, b, 0) & = [ q _ {2}, (b, S), (0, L) ] \\\\ \\delta (q _ {2}, b, \\times) & = [ q _ {3}, (b, L), (\\times , R) ] \\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.116, 0.907, 0.938, 0.926], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "当两个带头读到的符号相同时, 带头 2 右移一格, 进入状态 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "{q}_{4}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " (注意, 此时带头 1 不能"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 207, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.384, 0.065, 0.604, 0.081], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第5章 计算复杂性基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.857, 0.067, 0.894, 0.08], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "195"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.061, 0.099, 0.927, 0.145], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "左移,因为带头可能已经达到边界,需要进一步判断带头2指示的符号,才能决定带头1的动作),此时"}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "equation", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.329, 0.155, 0.657, 0.206], "content": "\\begin{array}{l} \\delta (q _ {3}, 1, 1) = [ q _ {4}, (1, S), (1, R) ] \\\\ \\delta (q _ {3}, 0, 0) = [ q _ {4}, (0, S), (0, R) ] \\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.105, 0.217, 0.832, 0.236], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果带头 2 读到符号 b，进入状态  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q_{5}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ；否则，带头 1 左移一格，返回状态  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q_{3}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，即"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.331, 0.245, 0.656, 0.414], "content": "\\begin{array}{l} \\delta (q _ {4}, 1, 1) = [ q _ {3}, (1, L), (1, S) ] \\\\ \\delta (q _ {4}, 1, 0) = [ q _ {3}, (1, L), (0, S) ] \\\\ \\delta (q _ {4}, 0, 1) = [ q _ {3}, (0, L), (1, S) ] \\\\ \\delta (q _ {4}, 0, 0) = [ q _ {3}, (0, L), (0, S) ] \\\\ \\delta (q _ {4}, 0, b) = [ q _ {5}, (0, S), (b, S) ] \\\\ \\delta (q _ {4}, 1, b) = [ q _ {5}, (1, S), (b, S) ] \\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.107, 0.422, 0.506, 0.441], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "图灵机的工作过程可以用格局序列描述。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.062, 0.457, 0.931, 0.559], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.10 一台图灵机 M 的某一格局是一个 k 元组  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(a_{1}, a_{2}, \\cdots, a_{k})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，其中  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{i}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  是一个形如 xqy 的字符串，这里 q 是 M 的当前状态，xy 是在当前状态 q 下第 i 条带上的符号串（不计右端空白符），第 i 个带头指向 y 的第一个符号，当 y 为空串时，第 i 个带头指向空白符。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.063, 0.567, 0.931, 0.613], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果图灵机计算一步后,它的格局由  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  变成了  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 就记做  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D_{1} \\rightarrow D_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  (读做“进入”), 对于  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\geqslant 2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 如果有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.391, 0.621, 0.602, 0.639], "content": "D _ {1} \\rightarrow D _ {2} \\rightarrow \\dots \\rightarrow D _ {n}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.064, 0.648, 0.142, 0.666], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "就记做"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.442, 0.678, 0.555, 0.701], "content": "D _ {1} \\xrightarrow {*} D _ {n}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.063, 0.71, 0.928, 0.755], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果对于某一 k 元组  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(a_{1}, a_{2}, \\cdots, a_{k})"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  和某一输入串  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_{1}c_{2}\\cdots c_{n}, c_{i} \\in I,