, "content": "定理 5.5 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L(M)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一台非确定性图灵机 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 所可以接收的语言, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的时间复杂性是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "T(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。那么, 必存在一台确定性图灵机 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M'"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 它所接收的语言 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L(M') = L(M)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 且时间复杂性是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(C^{T(n)})"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 其中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是某个正常数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 36, "bbox": [0.062, 0.884, 0.932, 0.931], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "若存在一个多项式 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p(x)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 使得对所有的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n > 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "T(n) \\leqslant p(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则称 NDTM 程序 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为一个多项式时间 NDTM 程序。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 216, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.085, 0.054, 0.122, 0.067], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "204"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.405, 0.053, 0.567, 0.069], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.051, 0.088, 0.917, 0.133], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "有了上述这些准备工作,则现在可以引进另一类重要的语言:NP 类 (the class NP), 其有如下定义。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.095, 0.141, 0.898, 0.159], "content": [{"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathrm{NP} = \\{L:"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 存在一个多项式时间NDTM程序 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 能被 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 识别，即 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L = L_{M}\\}"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.051, 0.167, 0.919, 0.213], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "以下将简单地说多项式时间非确定算法,并将 NP 类语言与所有可用多项式时间非确定性算法求解的判定问题等同看待。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.051, 0.221, 0.92, 0.266], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "到现在为止,已经定义了 P 类问题和 NP 类问题。那么,它们之间的关系是怎样的呢? 由这两类问题的定义,有下面两个基本的结论。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.051, 0.274, 0.921, 0.374], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "首先，P 是 NP 的子集，即  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P \\subseteq NP"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。这是因为任何确定性算法都可以作为任一非确定性算法的检验阶段。例如，如果  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi \\in P"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，A 为求解  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的一个多项式时间确定性算法，则可以通过将 A 用做算法的检验阶段而忽略猜想阶段不计，来得到求解  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的一个多项式时间非确定性算法。因此  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi \\in P"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  意味着  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi \\in NP"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.096, 0.382, 0.484, 0.399], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "其次,这里有下述对 NP 类问题的刻画。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.051, 0.415, 0.92, 0.46], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 5.6 若 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi \\in \\mathrm{NP}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则存在一个多项式 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 可以用一个时间复杂性为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(2^{p(n)})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的确定性算法来求解。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.098, 0.468, 0.25, 0.486], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "此定理证明略。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.051, 0.495, 0.922, 0.685], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "既然 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P \\subseteq \\mathrm{NP}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 一个很自然的问题就是究竟 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是 NP 的真子集呢? 还是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 与 NP 是一样的呢? 这个所谓 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P = \\mathrm{NP}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的问题多年来一直是计算领域所面临的最重要的理论问题之一, 至今仍无肯定和否定的证明。但是, 定理 5.6 的证明指出: 在非确定性图灵机上时间复杂性为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的判定问题与在确定性图灵机上时间复杂性为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q(n) \\cdot k^{q(n)}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的判定问题相当, 因此直观上多项式时间不确定性算法要比多项式时间确定性算法的速度快得多, 应能求解后者所不能解决的许多复杂问题, 所以人们普遍认为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 应是 NP 的真子集。关于这方面的研究, 两种主要的思路如下:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.053, 0.692, 0.922, 0.737], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) 证明 NP 类中的某些问题是难解的, 从而得出 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P \\neq \\mathrm{NP}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。但要证明这一点似乎与证明 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P = \\mathrm{NP}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 同样困难。到目前为止仍没有任何好的证明方法。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.052, 0.745, 0.923, 0.818], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 考虑 NP 类中问题之间的关系, 从中找到一些具有特定性质的、与 P 中问题有显著不同的问题。其实, 沿着这一研究路线, 人们已经证明了在 NP 类中存在一个称为 NP 完全的 (NP-Complete, NPC) 子类, 并由此发展出了一套著名的 NP 完全理论。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.054, 0.85, 0.271, 0.872], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5.5 NP 完全性"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.097, 0.906, 0.92, 0.925], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "通常,一个问题 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Q"}, {"type": "text", "content": " (常常是判定问题)可以被归约为另一个问题 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Q'"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Q"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的任何实"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 217, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.369, 0.061, 0.587, 0.077], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第 5 章 计算复杂性基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.841, 0.063, 0.877, 0.076], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "205"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.046, 0.095, 0.912, 0.197], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例都可以被“容易地重新描述为” "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Q'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的实例,而 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Q'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的实例的解也是Q的实例的解。例如,求解关于未知量x的线性方程问题可以转化为求解二次方程问题。已知一个实例 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "ax+b=0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,可以把它变换为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "0x^{2}+ax+b=0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,其解也是方程 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "ax+b=0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的解。因此,如果一个问题Q可以转化为另一个问题 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Q'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,则从某种意义上来说,Q并不比 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Q'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 更难解决。"}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.047, 0.213, 0.912, 0.288], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.17 称语言 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 在多项式时间内可以归约为语言 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " (写做 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1} \\leqslant_{p} L_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "), 是指存在一个多项式时间可计算的函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f: \\{0, 1\\}^{*} \\rightarrow \\{0, 1\\}^{*}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " (这里将前文的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Sigma"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 限定为 0, 1), 满足对所有的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\in \\{0, 1\\}^{*}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 都有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.353, 0.297, 0.603, 0.315], "content": "x \\in L _ {1} \\text {当且仅当} x \\in L _ {2}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.046, 0.324, 0.686, 0.342], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "称函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为归约函数, 计算 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的多项式时间算法 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathrm{F}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 称为归约算法。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.092, 0.359, 0.905, 0.378], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "引理5.1 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1}, L_{2} \\subseteq \\{0, 1\\}^{*}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是满足 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1} \\leqslant_{p} L_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的语言，则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{2} \\in P"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 蕴含着 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1} \\in P"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.091, 0.387, 0.505, 0.405], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 5.7 多项式归结具有如下基本性质:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.091, 0.414, 0.515, 0.432], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) 如果  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1} \\in P"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  且  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{2} \\leqslant_{p} L_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，则  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{2} \\in P"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.092, 0.442, 0.533, 0.461], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 如果  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1} \\leqslant_{p} L_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{2} \\leqslant_{p} L_{3}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，则  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1} \\leqslant_{p} L_{3}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.047, 0.478, 0.914, 0.609], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Sigma_{1}, \\Sigma_{2}, \\Sigma_{3}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 分别为语言 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1}, L_{2}, L_{3}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的字符集, 令 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f_{1}: \\Sigma_{1}^{*} \\to \\Sigma_{2}^{*}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的一个多项式变换, 而 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f_{2}: \\Sigma_{2}^{*} \\to \\Sigma_{3}^{*}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{3}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的一个多项式变换。那么对于所有的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\in \\Sigma_{1}^{*}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 由 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(x) = f_{2}(f_{1}(x))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 所定义的函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f: \\Sigma_{1}^{*} \\to \\Sigma_{3}^{*}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 就是从 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{3}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 所需要的变换。显然 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(x) \\in L_{3}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 当且仅当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\in L_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 而 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的值可以由一个多项式时间 DTM 程序来计算。 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\square"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.047, 0.617, 0.915, 0.72], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "多项式时间归约提供了一种形式方法,用来证明一个问题在一个多项式时间因子内至少与另一个问题一样难。亦即,如果  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1} \\leqslant_{p} L_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 则  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  大于  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的难度不会超过一个多项式时间因子。现在,就可以定义 NP 完全语言的集合,这些都是 NP 中最难的问题。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.049, 0.734, 0.914, 0.781], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.18 语言 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L \\subseteq \\{0,1\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 如果对每一个 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L' \\in \\mathrm{NP}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L' \\leqslant_{p} L"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则称 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是 NP 困难的 (NP-hard)。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.049, 0.797, 0.916, 0.843], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.19 语言 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L \\in \\mathrm{NP}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 如果对每一个 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L' \\in \\mathrm{NP}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L' \\leqslant_p L"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则称 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是 NP 完全的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.093, 0.852, 0.698, 0.87], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "正如下列定理所述，NP 完全性是判定 P 是否等于 NP 的关键。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.049, 0.887, 0.917, 0.933], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 5.8 如果任何 NP 完全问题是多项式时间可求解的, 则 P = NP。等价地, 如果 NP 中的任何问题不是多项式时间可求解的, 则所有 NP 完全问题都不是多项式时间可求"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 218, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.088, 0.059, 0.123, 0.072], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "206"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.407, 0.056, 0.569, 0.072], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.054, 0.093, 0.116, 0.11], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解的。"}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.052, 0.126, 0.922, 0.199], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 假定 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L \\in P"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 并且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L \\in \\mathrm{NPC}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。对任意的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L' \\in \\mathrm{NP}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 由定理5.7中的性质2, 有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L' \\leqslant_p L"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。这样, 根据引理5.1, 就有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L' \\in P"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。这样就证明了本定理的第一个结论。第二个结论是第一个结论的对换句, 因此第二个结论也得以证明。 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\square"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.054, 0.208, 0.924, 0.309], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "正是这个原因,对  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P \\neq NP"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  问题的研究都是以 NP 完全问题为中心的。大部分从事理论研究的计算机科学家们都认为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P \\neq NP"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，据此可以导出图 5.5 中所示的 P、NP 与 NPC 之间的关系。但是,如果能找出关于一个 NP 完全问题的多项式时间算法,这样就能证明 P = NP。"}]}, {"type": "image", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.338, 0.326, 0.64, 0.459], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.338, 0.326, 0.64, 0.459], "content": ""}, {"type": "image_caption", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.313, 0.471, 0.669, 0.487], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "图 5.5 P、NP 与 NPC 的关系的一种猜测"}]}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.056, 0.506, 0.926, 0.665], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "在多项式变换的含义下,可以将语言划分为不同的等价类。具体的,两种语言 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " (类似的,两个判定问题 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ") 称为是多项式等价的,如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1} \\leqslant_{p} L_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1} \\leqslant_{p} L_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 同时成立。进一步,该定理说明关系 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\leqslant_{p}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 在这些语言(或者判定问题)等价类上建立了一个偏序。不难推出,"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 类问题组成了这一偏序下“最小”的等价类,从而可以看成是由计算上“最容易”的语言(判定问题)所构成。相反,由 NP 完全语言(问题)所形成的另一个等价类则包含了 NP 类中那些“最困难”的语言(问题)。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.058, 0.681, 0.926, 0.727], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 5.9 若 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 都属于 NP, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是 NP 完全的, 且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1} \\leqslant_{p} L_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 那么 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 必是 NP 完全的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.059, 0.743, 0.926, 0.82], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 因为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1} \\in \\mathrm{NP}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 所以下面只需要证明对每个 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L^{\\prime} \\in \\mathrm{NP}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L^{\\prime}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 可通过多项式归约到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。考虑任一 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L^{\\prime} \\in \\mathrm{NP}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 因为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是 NP 完全的, 故必有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L^{\\prime}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 多项式归约到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。那么, 根据定理 5.8 的传递性, 有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L^{\\prime} \\leqslant_{p} L_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 所以 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "L_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是 NP 完全的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.059, 0.828, 0.926, 0.874], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "这个定理指出了证明一个新问题是 NP 完全的直接方法。那就是:要证明问题 II 为 NP 完全的,只需证明下列两个事实。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.106, 0.884, 0.265, 0.901], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 属于 NP;"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.105, 0.91, 0.665, 0.928], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 某个已知的 NP 完全问题 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi^{\\prime}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 可通过多项式变换到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 219, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.372, 0.06, 0.592, 0.076], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第5章 计算复杂性基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.844, 0.062, 0.882, 0.075], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "207"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.048, 0.095, 0.918, 0.225], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "然而,能使用这个证明方法的前提是已经有了某些(至少是一个)已知为 NP 完全的问题,到现在为止,还未提到一个 NP 完全问题。那么,NP 完全问题在实际中存在吗?其实,早在 1971 年,Cook 就在其发表的文章中,使用原始定义证明了第一个 NP 完全问题——可满足性问题(satisfiability problem),由此奠定了 NP 完全理论的基础,这就是 NP 完全理论的重要支柱之一,著名的 Cook 定理。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.049, 0.257, 0.452, 0.28], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5.6 若干典型的 NP 完全问题"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.049, 0.314, 0.917, 0.389], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Cook 定理使人们能够将可满足性问题(SAT 问题)归约到他们想要证明的问题上,因此做出了巨大贡献。但是由于使用原始定义来证明 SAT 问题的 NP 完全性比较冗长复杂,这里就不加证明了,只给出 Cook 定理。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.094, 0.404, 0.774, 0.422], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 5.10 （Cook 定理）布尔表达式的可满足性问题是 NP 完全的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.049, 0.431, 0.918, 0.505], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Cook 定理的重要性是明显的,它实际上给出了第一个 NP 完全问题。对于任何问题 Q, 只要能证明: ① "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Q \\in \\mathrm{NP}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "; ② "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathrm{SAT} \\leqslant_{p} Q"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Q \\in \\mathrm{NPC}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。于是, Cook 定理之后, 证明一个问题 Q 的 NP 完全性由下述三步组成:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.094, 0.514, 0.377, 0.532], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step1: 证明问题 Q 属于 NP;"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.094, 0.541, 0.496, 0.559], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step2: 选择一个已知的 NP 完全问题  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Q'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ;"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.095, 0.569, 0.522, 0.587], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step3: 构造从  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Q'"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  到 Q 的多项式变换函数 f。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.049, 0.597, 0.921, 0.753], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "就是根据这样的思路,在 Cook 定理证明了这一结果后,人们很快地证明了其他许多问题的 NP 完全性。根据公式可满足性进行归约,可以证明很多问题是 NP 完全问题。归约算法必须能够处理任何输入公式,但这样一来,就必须考虑大量的情况。因此,常常需要根据布尔公式的一种限制性语言来进行归约,使需要考虑的情况较少。当然,不能由于对该语言的限制过多,而使其成为多项式时间内可解的语言。3-CNF 可满足性(或 3-CNF-SAT)就是这样一种方便的语言。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.051, 0.761, 0.922, 0.863], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "在布尔公式中,一个文字是指变量或者变量的“非”;一个子句是一个或多个文字的“或”。多个子句相“与”,所得到的布尔公式称为合取范式,或 CNF(Conjunctive Normal Form)。如果公式中每个子句恰好有三个不同的变量,则该公式称为 3-合取范式,即 3-CNF。例如,"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(x_1 \\lor \\neg x_1 \\lor x_2) \\land (x_3 \\lor x_2 \\lor x_4) \\land (\\neg x_1 \\lor \\neg x_3 \\lor \\neg x_4)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.096, 0.879, 0.786, 0.897], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 5.11 3-合取范式形式的布尔公式的可满足性问题是 NP 完全的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.096, 0.914, 0.922, 0.932], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 3-CNF-SAT 是 SAT 问题的一种特殊情况,既然 SAT 问题属于 NP,因此 3-"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 220, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.088, 0.056, 0.125, 0.069], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "208"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.407, 0.055, 0.569, 0.07], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.053, 0.089, 0.922, 0.136], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "CNF-SAT 也属于 NP。接下来需要证明, 能把 SAT 问题归约到 3-CNF-SAT 问题, 且归约过程能在多项式时间内完成。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.054, 0.144, 0.924, 0.189], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "为输入公式 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\phi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 构造一棵二叉“语法分析”树, 文字作为树叶, 连接词作为内部顶点。式 (5.1) 如下"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.246, 0.198, 0.919, 0.217], "content": "\\phi = ((x _ {1} \\rightarrow x _ {2}) \\vee \\neg (\\neg x _ {1} \\leftrightarrow x _ {3}) \\vee x _ {4}) \\wedge \\neg x _ {2}\\tag{5.1}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.054, 0.225, 0.924, 0.3], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果输入公式中有包含数个文字的“或”的子句, 就可以利用结合律给表达式加上括号, 以使在所产生的树中的每一个内部顶点上均有一个或两个子女。现在, 就可以把二叉语法分析树看做是计算该函数的一个电路了。SAT 公式的语法分析树如图 5.6 所示。"}]}, {"type": "image", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.368, 0.308, 0.615, 0.551], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.368, 0.308, 0.615, 0.551], "content": ""}, {"type": "image_caption", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.352, 0.567, 0.632, 0.584], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "图 5.6 SAT 公式的语法分析树"}]}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.059, 0.603, 0.925, 0.65], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "下面引入一个变量 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y_{i}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 作为每个内部顶点的输出。然后，把原始公式 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\phi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 改写为根变量与描述每个顶点操作的子句的合取的“与”。式(5.1)经改写后所得的表达式为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.34, 0.657, 0.642, 0.817], "content": "\\begin{array}{r l}\\phi^ {\\prime} = y _ {1} \\wedge (y _ {1} \\leftrightarrow (y _ {2} \\wedge \\neg x _ {2}))\\\\&\\wedge (y _ {2} \\leftrightarrow (y _ {3} \\vee y _ {4}))\\\\&\\wedge (y _ {3} \\leftrightarrow (x _ {1} \\rightarrow x _ {2}))\\\\&\\wedge (y _ {4} \\leftrightarrow \\neg y _ {5})\\\\&\\wedge (y _ {5} \\leftrightarrow (y _ {6} \\vee y _ {4}))\\\\&\\wedge (y _ {6} \\leftrightarrow (\\neg x _ {1} \\leftrightarrow x _ {3}))\\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.058, 0.826, 0.929, 0.928], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "注意,这样得到的公式是各子句的合取式,每一个子句至多有3个文字。根据离散数学中的相关定理可以知道,任何n个变量的子句可以等价于n个变量的一个合取范式(将真值表中值为1的项“与”起来)。因此 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\phi'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 必然可以等价于一些不超过3个变量的合取范式的“与”,记这个式子为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\phi''"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\phi''"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的一个句子,刚好有3个变量,则保持不变;如"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 221, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.376, 0.064, 0.596, 0.08], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第 5 章 计算复杂性基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.85, 0.066, 0.886, 0.079], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "209"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.055, 0.099, 0.921, 0.201], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "果只有2个变量, 如 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x_{i} \\vee x_{j}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 那么可以引入整个 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\phi''"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的另一个变量 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x_{k}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 将该句子变成 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(x_{i} \\vee x_{j} \\vee x_{k}) \\wedge (x_{i} \\vee x_{j} \\vee \\neg x_{k})"}, {"type": "text", "content": "; 如果只有一个变量, 改造方法类似。通过改造后得到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\phi'''"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\phi'''"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的所有句子恰好是3个变量的析取, 而且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\phi'''"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是这些句子的合取, 即 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\phi'''"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个3-CNF。"}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.054, 0.209, 0.921, 0.256], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果 SAT 问题是可满足的,那么 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\phi''"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是可满足的; 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\phi''"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 可满足, 则原 SAT 也是可满足的, 因为进行的是等价变换。这样, 就可以将 SAT 问题归约到了 3-CNF-SAT 问题。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.054, 0.292, 0.923, 0.421], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "上面讨论了3-CNF可满足性问题的NP完全性,下面接着分析团(或团集 CLIQUE)问题的 NP 完全性。无向图 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G = (V, E)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中的团是一个顶点子集 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "V' \\subseteq V"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 其中每一对顶点之间都由 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "E"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中的一条边相连。换句话说, 一个团是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的一个完全子图。团的规模是指它所包含的顶点数。团问题就是关于寻找图中规模最大的团的最优化问题。一个重要的判定问题是: 在图中是否存在一个给定规模为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的团, 其形式定义为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.236, 0.428, 0.739, 0.447], "content": "\\mathrm{CLIQUE} = \\{\\langle G, k \\rangle : G \\text {是具有规模为} k \\text {的团的图} \\}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.056, 0.456, 0.924, 0.558], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "要确定图 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是否包含一个规模为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的团, 一种朴素的算法是列出 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "V"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的所有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个子集,并对其中的每一个进行检查, 看它是否形成了一个团, 该算法的运行时间为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Omega (k^2 C_{|V|}^k)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为常数, 则它是多项式时间。但是在一般情况下, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 可能接近于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "|V| / 2"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 这样一来, 算法的运行时间就是超多项式时间。因此, 人们猜想不大可能存在关于团问题的有效算法。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.102, 0.574, 0.436, 0.592], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 5.12 团问题是 NP 完全的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.057, 0.608, 0.925, 0.682], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 为了证明 CLIQUE ∈ NP, 对给定的图 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G = (V, E)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 用团中顶点集 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "V' \\subseteq V"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 作为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的证书。对每一对顶点 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "u, v"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 通过检查边 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(u, v)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是否属于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "E"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 就可以在多项式时间内, 完成对 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "V'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是否是团的检查。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.103, 0.691, 0.83, 0.709], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "下一步来证明 3-CNF-SAT "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\leqslant_{p}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " CLIQUE，以此来说明团问题是 NP 完全的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.058, 0.719, 0.926, 0.822], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "从3-CNF-SAT的一个实例开始,说明归约算法。设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\phi = C_1 \\wedge C_2 \\wedge \\cdots \\wedge C_k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个具有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个子句的3-CNF形式的布尔公式。对 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r = 1, 2, \\cdots, k"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 每个子句 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C_r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 恰好有3个不同的文字 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "l_1^r, l_2^r, l_3^r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。下面将构造一个图 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\phi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是可满足性问题当且仅当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 包含一个规模为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的团。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.059, 0.831, 0.926, 0.879], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "图 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 构造如下, 对 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\phi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中的每个子句 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C_{r} = l_{1}^{r} \\vee l_{2}^{r} \\vee l_{3}^{r}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 把 3 个顶点 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "v_{1}^{r}, v_{2}^{r}, v_{3}^{r}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 组成的三元组放入 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "V"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中。如果下列两个条件同时满足, 就用一条边连接两个顶点 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "v_{i}^{r}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "v_{j}^{r}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.104, 0.888, 0.531, 0.906], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "v_{i}^{r}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  和  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "v_{j}^{s}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  处于不同的三元组中，即  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r \\neq s"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ;"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.105, 0.916, 0.594, 0.935], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 它们的相应文字是一致的, 即  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "l^{ri}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  不是  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "l_{j}^{s}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的非。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 222, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.082, 0.06, 0.12, 0.073], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "210"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.402, 0.059, 0.563, 0.075], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.046, 0.094, 0.915, 0.139], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "根据 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\phi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，可以很容易地在多项式时间内计算出该图。通过以下实例来说明这一构造过程。如果有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.147, 0.148, 0.812, 0.167], "content": "\\phi = (x _ {1} \\vee \\neg x _ {2} \\vee \\neg x _ {3}) \\wedge (\\neg x _ {1} \\vee x _ {2} \\vee x _ {3}) \\wedge (x _ {1} \\vee x _ {2} \\vee x _ {3})"}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.048, 0.175, 0.273, 0.193], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 就如图5.7所示。"}]}, {"type": "image", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.197, 0.204, 0.76, 0.379], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.197, 0.204, 0.76, 0.379], "content": ""}, {"type": "image_caption", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.385, 0.388, 0.581, 0.404], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "图5.7 由 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\phi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 生成的图"}]}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.047, 0.421, 0.917, 0.549], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "必须证明从 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\phi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的变换是一种归约过程。首先，假定 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\phi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 有一个可满足性赋值，那么，每个子句 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中至少有一个文字 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "l_i^r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 被赋值为1，而且每个这样的文字对应于一顶点 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "v_i^r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。从每个子句中挑选出一个这样的“真”文字，就得到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个顶点组成的集合 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "V'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。可以断言，"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "V'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个团。对任意两个顶点 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "v_i^r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "v_j^s"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，根据给定的可满足性赋值，两个顶点相应的文字和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 都被映射为1，这两个文字不可能是互补的关系。因此，由 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的构造过程可知，边 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(v_i^r, v_j^s)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 属于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "E"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.048, 0.555, 0.918, 0.656], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "反之,假定 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 有一个规模为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的团 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "V'"}, {"type": "text", "content": ",在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中没有连接同一个三元组中顶点的边,因此 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "V'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 包含每个三元组中的一个顶点。可以对每个满足 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "v_i^r \\in V"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的相应文字 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "l_i^r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 赋值 1 ,而不必担心会出现对一个文字与其补同时赋值为 1 的情形,这是因为在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中,没有连接不一致的文字的边。由于每个子句都是可满足的,所以 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\phi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 也是可满足的。"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\square"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.049, 0.663, 0.918, 0.764], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "最后讨论顶点覆盖(vertex cover)问题的 NP 完全性。无向图  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G = (V, E)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的顶点覆盖(vertex cover)是指子集  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "V' \\subseteq V"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，满足对任意  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(u, v) \\in E"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，则  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "u \\in V'"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  或  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "v \\in V'"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  成立。亦即，每个顶点“覆盖”与其关联的边，G 的顶点覆盖 E 中所有边的顶点组成的集合，顶点覆盖的规模是指它所包含的顶点数目。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.049, 0.771, 0.917, 0.845], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "顶点覆盖问题(vertex cover problem)是指在给定的图中,找出具有最小规模的顶点覆盖。把这一最优化问题重新表述为判定问题,即确定一个图是否具有一个给定规模 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的顶点覆盖。作为一种语言,定义"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.172, 0.853, 0.792, 0.871], "content": "\\text {VERTEX - COVER} = \\{\\langle G, k \\rangle : \\text {图} G \\text {具有规模为} k \\text {的顶点覆盖} \\}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.051, 0.88, 0.514, 0.898], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "下面的定理说明了该问题是一个 NP 完全问题。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.094, 0.914, 0.497, 0.932], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 5.13 顶点覆盖问题是 NP 完全的。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 223, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.389, 0.06, 0.608, 0.075], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第5章 计算复杂性基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.861, 0.061, 0.898, 0.074], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "211"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.067, 0.094, 0.931, 0.175], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 首先通过说明 CLIQUE "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\leqslant_{p}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " VERTEX-COVER 来证明顶点覆盖问题是 NP 困难的。这一归约过程是以图的“补图”概念为基础的。已知一个无向图 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G = (V, E)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，定义 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的补图 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\bar{G} = (V, \\bar{E})"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。换句话说，"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\bar{G}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是包含不在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中的那些边的图。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.066, 0.184, 0.933, 0.3], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "归约算法的输入是团问题的实例 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\langle G,k\\rangle"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。它计算出补图,这很容易在多项式时间内完成。归约算法的输出是顶点覆盖问题的实例 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\langle\\bar{G},|V|-k\\rangle"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。为了完成证明,下面来说明该变换的确是一个归约的过程: 图 G 具有一个规模为 k 的团,当且仅当图  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\bar{G}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  有一个规模为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "|V|-k"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的顶点覆盖。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.066, 0.308, 0.932, 0.487], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "假设 G 包含一个团  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "V' \\subseteq V"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。可以断言， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "V - V'"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  是 G 中的一个顶点覆盖。设  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(u, v)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  是 E 中的任意边，则有  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(u, v) \\notin E"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，这说明 u 或 v 至少有一个不属于  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "V'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，因为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "V'"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  中的每一对顶点间都有一条 E 中的边相连。等价地，u 或 v 至少有一个属于  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "V - V'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，这意味着边  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(u, v)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  被  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "V - V'"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  所覆盖。由于  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(u, v)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  是从 E 中任意选取的边，所以 E 的每条边都被 G 中的一个顶点所覆盖。因此，规模为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "|V| - k"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的集合  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "V - V'"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  形成 G 的一个顶点覆盖。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.066, 0.495, 0.932, 0.605], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "反之, 假设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 具有一个顶点覆盖 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "V' \\subseteq V"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 其中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "|V'| = |V| - k"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 那么, 对所有的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "u, v \\in V"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(u, v) \\in \\bar{E}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "u \\in \\bar{E}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 或 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "v \\in \\bar{E}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 或两者都成立。与此相对, 对所有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "u, v \\in V"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "u \\notin V'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "v \\notin V'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 则有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(u, v) \\in E"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。换句话说, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "V - V'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个团, 其规模为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "|v| - |v'| = k"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.066, 0.613, 0.935, 0.796], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "NP 完全理论是理论计算机科学领域取得的一项重要成果,它为一些难解的问题研究提供了理论基础,划分了计算难解的界限。它将原理上可计算的问题,划分为 P 类问题和 NP 类问题。在 NP 完全理论提出后的 40 多年时间里,它一直占据着算法分析和设计领域研究的中心位置。从第一个 NP 完全问题被证明之后到目前为止,已经宣布了成千上万个 NP 完全问题。一旦某个问题被证明是 NP 困难的,则可提醒人们该问题是无法用现代计算机有效求解的,从而避免了人们为此问题付出的大量无谓的努力。除了本节前面给出的 NP 完全问题外,下面几个问题也是经常遇到的 NP 完全问题。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.113, 0.804, 0.329, 0.821], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) 哈密顿回路问题。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.113, 0.831, 0.373, 0.848], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "实例:已知图  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G=(V,E)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.068, 0.859, 0.933, 0.904], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "问:G 是否存在一条哈密顿回路，即是否存在 G 的节点的一个排序序列  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\langle v_{1}, v_{2}, \\cdots, v_{n} \\rangle"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  使得  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(v_{i}, v_{(i+1) \\mod n}) \\in E, 1 \\leqslant i \\leqslant n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.114, 0.913, 0.283, 0.93], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 货郎担问题。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 224, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.079, 0.056, 0.116, 0.069], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "212"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.399, 0.055, 0.56, 0.07], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.089, 0.09, 0.388, 0.107], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "实例:已知图  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G=(V,E,W)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.047, 0.117, 0.912, 0.17], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "问: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的所有哈密顿回路中, 路径总长度最小的是哪条? 即求 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的节点的一个排列 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\langle v_{1}, v_{2}, \\cdots, v_{n} \\rangle"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\sum W(v_{i}, v_{(i+1) \\bmod n})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 最小, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1 \\leqslant i \\leqslant n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(v_{i}, v_{(i+1) \\bmod n}) \\in E"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.092, 0.183, 0.261, 0.2], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(3) 子集和问题。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.09, 0.211, 0.802, 0.229], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "实例:对于有限集 A, 每个  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a \\in A"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  赋值的  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "S(a) \\in Z^{+}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 以及一个正整数 B。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.09, 0.239, 0.72, 0.258], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "问:是否有子集 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A^{\\prime}\\subseteq A"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A^{\\prime}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中的元素的赋值之和恰好是B。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.045, 0.267, 0.915, 0.399], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "NP 完全问题广泛地来自图论、数学、电子电路、生物计算等方面。例如，子图同构问题、图着色、独立集问题、支配集问题、可平面子图问题、命中集、三维匹配、0/1 规划、有限资源分配、特殊作业调度、multi-cut 问题、最长路径问题、反馈顶点集问题和最大公式可满足问题等。这些 NP 完全问题既有实用价值，又有理论意义，因此吸引着广大计算机科学家和数学家进行深入的研究。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.046, 0.433, 0.575, 0.455], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5.7 计算复杂性理论在密码学中的应用"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.046, 0.489, 0.917, 0.789], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "传统的设计密码方案的方法,是针对密码算法安全性的目标,基于某个困难问题假设或者基础模块提出密码算法,公开接受安全性分析。如果经过较长时间的分析仍然不能破译,就认为它是安全的,或者在发现某些安全缺陷之后,对其进行修补和改进。由于新的密码算法分析技术的出现是不确定的,而任何新的分析技术都可能使得密码算法被宣告破解,所以传统的设计方法很难确保一个密码算法的安全性。事实上,一些一开始被认为很困难的密码体制被完全攻破(如基于背包问题的Chor-Rivest密码系统)。因此,一定时间内缺乏攻击绝不能就简单认定一个密码方案是安全可靠的。其中基于计算复杂度的可证明安全性的理论就是为解决上述问题而提出的一种有效的解决方案。可证明安全性的理论是一种公理化的设计思想,它可以保证:假如存在一个攻击者能够对密码协议或密码算法发动有效的攻击,那么就可以利用该攻击者构造一个算法用于求解困难问题或者破解密码模块。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.047, 0.797, 0.918, 0.928], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "可以证明安全性理论的应用价值是显而易见的:可以把主要精力集中在基本密码模块和计算困难问题的研究上,这些是基础性的、带有艺术色彩的研究工作;作为密码协议基本组件或者密码方案的计算困难假设,如果这些基本模块是不安全的,所设计的方案一定也是不安全的。另一方面,可证明安全性理论本质上是一种公理化研究方法,其最基础的假设是“好”的密码模块存在。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 225, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.381, 0.061, 0.601, 0.076], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第 5 章 计算复杂性基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.853, 0.063, 0.892, 0.076], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "213"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.103, 0.103, 0.453, 0.121], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1. 基于计算复杂度安全的基本思想"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.057, 0.13, 0.926, 0.204], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "与基于信息论的完全保密和加密方案不同,基于计算复杂度的可证明安全的要求,是不能在合理的时间内,以合理的成功概率攻破就足够了,这包含了如下两种放宽的完美安全的概念:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.102, 0.212, 0.903, 0.231], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) 仅仅在对抗“有效的”敌手时, 安全性存在, “有效的”是指在可行的时间内运行。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.102, 0.239, 0.835, 0.258], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 敌手潜在的成功概率是非常小的(小到甚至不关心它是否真的会发生)。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.057, 0.267, 0.929, 0.396], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "下面采用渐进方法来刻画上述提及的概念,即将敌手的运行时间及成功的概率视为某个参数的函数,而不是具体的数值。特别是,一个密码方案将包含一个安全参数,即整数 n。当双方初始化方案(即生成密钥)时,它们选择某个 n 值作为安全参数:假设这个值被任何攻击该方案的敌手知道。那么敌手的运行时间(以及诚实方的运行时间)及敌手的成功概率将都被看做 n 的函数。于是有:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.057, 0.403, 0.929, 0.532], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) 将“可行的策略”或者“有效的算法”的概念, 和在以 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为参数的多项式时间内 (可用 PPT 来代表概率多项式时间) 运行的概率算法等同看待。这意味着, 对于一些常量 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 安全参数为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 该算法运行时间为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a \\cdot n^{c}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。要求诚实方在多项式时间内运行, 并且仅关心多项式时间的敌手。而且, 一个需要超多项式时间的攻击策略不被认为是在现实有威胁的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.059, 0.54, 0.929, 0.615], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 将“小的成功概率”的概念和成功概率小于任何以 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为参数的多项式倒数等同看待, 这意味着对于每个常量 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的值足够大, 敌手成功的概率小于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n^{-c}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。比任何多项式的倒数增长得都慢的函数被称为可忽略的(negligible)。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.105, 0.623, 0.404, 0.641], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "因此,有如下渐进安全的定义。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.06, 0.658, 0.929, 0.705], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.20 如果每个 PPT 敌手以可忽略的概率成功攻破一个方案,那么该方案是安全的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.06, 0.72, 0.931, 0.878], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 5.10 假设有一个安全的方案,一个运行了 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n^{3} \\min"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的敌手能够成功“攻破该方案”的概率为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{40} \\cdot 2^{-n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " (这是一个可以忽略的关于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的函数)。当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\leqslant 40"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 意味着一个运行 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "40^{3} \\min"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 钟(大约6周)的敌手能够攻破该方案的概率为1, 所以那样的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 值不是很有用。甚至当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n = 50"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 一个运行 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "50^{3} \\min"}, {"type": "text", "content": " (大约3个月)的敌手能够攻破该方案的概率约为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1 / 1000"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 这是不能被接受的。从另外一个方面, 当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n = 500"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时, 一个运行时间超过200年的敌手攻破该方案的概率仅仅为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{-500}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.06, 0.886, 0.932, 0.933], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "上面的例子指出,可以将一个更大的安全参数看做是提供了更高的安全级别。就大部分情况而言,安全参数决定了诚实方使用的密钥长度,因此有个类似的概念,即密钥越"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 226, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.079, 0.057, 0.116, 0.07], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "214"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.4, 0.055, 0.562, 0.07], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.045, 0.09, 0.915, 0.164], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "长, 安全程度越高。通过使用一个更大的安全参数数值来“增强安全性”的能力有着很重要的实用意义, 因为它能够使诚实方抵御敌手计算能力的增强及算法的进步。下面的例子将充分反映这一点是如何在实际中体现的。"}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.046, 0.179, 0.915, 0.225], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 5.11 假设有一个密码学方案,诚实方被要求运行 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "10^{6} \\cdot n^{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个时钟周期,同时,运行 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "10^{8} \\cdot n^{4}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个周期的敌手能够成功“攻破”该方案的概率为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{20} \\cdot 2^{-n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.045, 0.234, 0.916, 0.308], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "假设所有的各方都是用 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1 \\mathrm{MHz}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的计算机, 并且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n = 50"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。则诚实方运行 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "10^{6} \\cdot 2500"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个周期, 或 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2.5 \\mathrm{~s}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "; 同时, 一个运行 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "10^{8} \\cdot (50)^{4}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个周期或者大概 7 天的敌手, 能够攻破该方案的概率只有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{-30}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.045, 0.317, 0.917, 0.418], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "现在假设一台 16MHz 的计算机是可用的,并且所有各方都升级更新。诚实方能够将 n 增长到 100(需要生产一个新的密钥),运行时间仍然被改进到 0.625s。相比之下,敌手现在不得不运行 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "10^{7}\\mathrm{s}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ",或者超过 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "10^{6}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 周,来实现成功概率 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{-80}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。一个运行速度更快的计算机的影响就是使得敌手的工作更加困难。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.047, 0.426, 0.918, 0.528], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "渐进方法的优点就是不需要依赖于任何特定的假设,如敌手使用机器的类型。另一个方面,正如上面的例子证明的,在实际中,准确地理解一个特殊的渐进安全方案等同于什么级别的具体安全是有必要的。这是因为,诚实方必须选择一个具体的 n 值来使用,并且不能依赖于对足够大的 n 值的保证。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.047, 0.542, 0.918, 0.644], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "有效计算:前面已经定义有效计算是指能够在“概率多项式时间”(PPT)内执行的计算。一个算法 A 被认为在多项式时间运行是指:如果存在一个多项式  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p(\\cdot)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，使得对于每个输入  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\in \\{0,1\\}^{*}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A(x)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的计算最多在  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p(|x|)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  个步骤内终止(这里  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "|x|"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  表示的是字符串 x 的长度)。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.048, 0.659, 0.919, 0.787], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "可忽略的成功概率。现代密码学认为能以非常小的概率被攻破的密码方案是安全的。因此，对某个多项式 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，如果一个敌手能够成功地攻破该方案的概率为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1/p(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则该方案被认为是不安全的。但是，对任意多项式 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，如果攻破该方案的概率渐进小于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1/p(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则认为该方案是安全的。这是因为敌手成功的概率太小，这样的概率叫做可忽略的，具体定义如下。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.049, 0.802, 0.918, 0.863], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.21 函数 f 为可忽略的, 如果对于每个多项式  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p(\\cdot)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 存在一个 N, 使得对于所有的整数 n > N, 都满足  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n) < \\frac{1}{p(n)}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.095, 0.875, 0.46, 0.892], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "通常将一个可忽略函数表示为 neg l。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.094, 0.908, 0.918, 0.926], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 5.12 函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{-n}, 2^{-\\sqrt{n}}, n^{-\\log n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 都是可忽略的。但是, 它们接近零的速度是不同的。下"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 227, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.375, 0.061, 0.595, 0.077], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第5章 计算复杂性基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.848, 0.062, 0.884, 0.075], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "215"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.054, 0.095, 0.623, 0.114], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "面计算什么样的 n 值, 会使得每一个函数的值都小于  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "10^{-6}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.096, 0.123, 0.612, 0.141], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{20} = 1048576"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，因此对于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n\\geqslant 20"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{n} <   10^{-6}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.097, 0.15, 0.673, 0.169], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{\\sqrt{400}} = 1048576"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，因此对于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\geqslant 400"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{-\\sqrt{n}} < 10^{-6}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.097, 0.178, 0.67, 0.197], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(3) "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "32^{5}=33\\ 554\\ 432"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，因此对于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n\\geqslant32"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n^{-\\log n}<10^{-6}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.097, 0.215, 0.575, 0.233], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理5.14 令 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathrm{neg}l_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathrm{neg}l_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为可忽略函数，则:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.097, 0.242, 0.893, 0.262], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) 函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathrm{neg} l_{3}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 被定义为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathrm{neg} l_{3}(n)=\\mathrm{neg} l_{1}(n)+\\mathrm{neg} l_{2}(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则该函数是可忽略的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.053, 0.27, 0.92, 0.317], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 对于任何正多项式 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathrm{neg} l_{4}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 被定义为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathrm{neg} l_{4}(n) = p(n) \\cdot \\mathrm{neg} l_{1}(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则该函数是可忽略的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.053, 0.325, 0.922, 0.4], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "对可以忽略的概率发生事件,因为几乎不可能发生,所以对所有实践用途,它们可被忽略。因此,一个攻破密码方案的事件若发生的概率是可忽略的,则是不重要的。最后给出渐进安全的一般定义如下。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.053, 0.415, 0.923, 0.489], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.22 如果每个概率多项式时间的敌手 A 执行某个特定类型的攻击, 对于每个多项式  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p(\\cdot)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，存在一个整数 N，对 n > N，A 在这次攻击中成功的概率小于  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1/p(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，则这个方案是安全的。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.098, 0.505, 0.383, 0.523], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2. 基于计算安全的加密方案"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.053, 0.531, 0.926, 0.743], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如前所述,如果给予足够的时间,一个计算安全(而不是完全保密)的密码方案往往能够被攻破。为了无条件地证明某方案是计算安全的,需要证明攻破该方案所需要时间的下界。特别地,需要证明该方案不能被任何多项式时间算法攻破。不幸的是,当前还不能证明该类型的下界。取而代之的策略是,假设某个低层次难题很难解决,然后证明基于这个假设,构造密码方案是安全的。只要构造所依赖的问题是困难的,则给定的密码学构造方案就是安全的,对这一逻辑关系进行证明的一般方式是,陈述一个显式规约,说明如何将任何概率不可忽略的,且成功“攻破”该构造方案的有效敌手A,转换为成功解决该难题的有效算法 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。具体做法如下:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.054, 0.751, 0.924, 0.797], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) 指定某个有效的(即概率多项式时间)敌手 A 攻击  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，将敌手的成功概率表示为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varepsilon(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.055, 0.805, 0.928, 0.935], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 构造一个叫做“规约”的有效算法 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A'"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 该算法将敌手 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 作为子程序来使用, 试图解决难题 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "X"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。这里指定难题 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "X"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的某个输入实例 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 有效算法 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 将会对敌手 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 模拟出一个 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的实例, 满足敌手 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 与 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 交互。更正式地说, 当敌手 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 作为子程序被有效算法 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 运行时, 它的分布应该和当有效算法 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 自身与 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 交互时的分布是相同的; 如果敌手 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 成功攻破了由 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 模拟的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的实例, 则这将允许 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 解决给出的难题实例 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 成功的概率至少为多项式"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 228, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.086, 0.06, 0.124, 0.073], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "216"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.406, 0.058, 0.568, 0.073], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.053, 0.093, 0.248, 0.111], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "的倒数, 即  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1/p(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.048, 0.12, 0.922, 0.194], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(3) 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varepsilon(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 不是可忽略的, 则有效算法 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 解决难题 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "X"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的概率为不可忽略的概率 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varepsilon(n)/p(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。因为有效算法 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是有效的, 将 PPT 敌手 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 作为子程序来运行, 意味着存在一个有效的算法能够以不可忽略的概率解决 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "X"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 这与原假设矛盾。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.052, 0.201, 0.922, 0.248], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(4) 因而结论是, 给定一个关于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "X"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的假设, 不存在有效的敌手 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 能够以不可忽略的概率成功攻破 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 即 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是计算上安全的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.053, 0.263, 0.922, 0.309], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.23 一个对称密钥加密方案是概率多项式时间算法(Gen, Enc, Dec)的三元组。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.054, 0.317, 0.923, 0.39], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) 密钥生成算法 Gen 的输入为安全参数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1^{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 输出为密钥 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": ": 记为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k \\leftarrow \\operatorname{Gen}(1^{n})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " (要强调 Gen 是一个随机算法)。不失一般性, 假设任何由 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\operatorname{Gen}(1^{n})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 输出的密钥 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 都满足 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "|k| \\geqslant n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.055, 0.397, 0.922, 0.443], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 加密算法 Enc 将密钥 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和明文消息 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m \\in \\{0,1\\}^*"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 作为输入, 并且输出一个密文 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。因为 Enc 可能是随机化的, 记为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c \\leftarrow \\mathrm{Enc}_k(m)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.055, 0.451, 0.922, 0.497], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(3) 解密算法 Dec 将密钥 k 和密文 c 作为输入, 输出消息 m。假设 Dec 是确定性的, 所以记为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m := \\text{Dec}_{k}(c)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.099, 0.506, 0.876, 0.524], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "需要满足的是:对每个 n、由 Gen(1"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "^{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ") 输出的密钥 k 及每个 m ∈ {0,1} "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "^{*}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，都满足"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.382, 0.532, 0.595, 0.55], "content": "\\mathrm{Dec} (\\mathrm{Enc} _ {k} (m)) = m _ {\\circ}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.053, 0.559, 0.924, 0.633], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果(Gen, Enc, Dec)满足:对每个由 Gen(1"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "^{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ")输出的密钥 k，算法 Enc"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "_{k}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "只对消息 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m \\in \\{0, 1\\}^{l(n)}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 有定义，则假设(Gen, Enc, Dec)是一个消息长度为定长 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "l(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的对称密钥加密方案。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.101, 0.641, 0.435, 0.66], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "窃听不可区分实验 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathrm{Priv}K_{A,\\prod}^{\\mathrm{eav}}(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " :"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.102, 0.669, 0.683, 0.687], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) 输入 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1^{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 给敌手 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A, A"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 输出一对长度相等的消息 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m_{0}, m_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.056, 0.695, 0.924, 0.741], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 运行 Gen( "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1^{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ) 生成一个密钥 k，选择一个随机比特数 b， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b \\leftarrow \\{0,1\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。一个密文  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c \\leftarrow \\text{Enc}_{k}(m_{b})"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  被计算并且给 A。把 c 叫做挑战密文。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.102, 0.748, 0.365, 0.767], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(3) A 输出一个比特数  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.058, 0.775, 0.922, 0.822], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(4) 该实验的输出被定义为: 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b = b'"}, {"type": "text", "content": "; 则为 1; 否则为 0。如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\text{Priv} K_{A, \\prod}^{\\text{eav}}(n) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则称 A 成功。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.057, 0.83, 0.928, 0.93], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "这里除了要求长度是相等的以外,加密消息 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m_0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m_1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的长度是没有限制的。(当然,因为敌手被限制在多项式时间内运行,"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m_0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m_1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的长度为以 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为参数的多项式)如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个定长方案,消息长度为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "l(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ",那么上面的实验要被修改,需要 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m_0, m_1 \\in \\{0, 1\\}^{l(n)}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。不可区分性的定义说明了:如果在上面的实验中,任何 PPT 敌手的成功概率的最大值高于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1/2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 229, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.373, 0.06, 0.594, 0.075], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第 5 章 计算复杂性基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.846, 0.061, 0.884, 0.075], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "217"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.051, 0.094, 0.438, 0.113], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "部分可忽略,则一个加密方案是安全的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.093, 0.129, 0.918, 0.148], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.24 如果对于所有的概率多项式时间敌手 A, 存在一个可忽略函数 neg l 使得"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.282, 0.156, 0.682, 0.177], "content": "p (\\mathrm{Priv} K _ {A, \\prod} ^ {\\mathrm{eav}} (n) = 1) \\leqslant 1 / 2 + \\mathrm{neg} l (n)"}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.05, 0.185, 0.919, 0.26], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "则一个对称密钥加密方案 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\Pi = (\\text{Gen}, \\text{Enc}, \\text{Dec})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 具备在窃听者存在的情况下具有不可区分性。其中概率的来源是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的随机性及实验的随机性（选择密钥、随机比特数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，以及在加密过程中使用到的任何随机性）。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.051, 0.268, 0.918, 0.314], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "该定义是对“所有的”概率多项式时间的敌手定量分析,意味着对所有“可行的”策略,即对于能够在多项式时间执行的策略而言,都是安全的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.05, 0.323, 0.92, 0.37], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "前面已经定义了什么是加密方案的安全性,在给出一个安全的加密方案之前,需要先介绍伪随机发生器的概念。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.051, 0.385, 0.921, 0.461], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 5.25(伪随机发生器) 令 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "l(\\cdot)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为多项式, 令 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为确定多项式时间算法, 该算法满足对于任意输入 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "s \\in \\{0,1\\}^n"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 算法 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 输出一个长度为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "l(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的字符串。如果该算法还满足下面两个条件, 则称 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个伪随机发生器。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.097, 0.469, 0.464, 0.487], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) 对于每个 n 来说, 满足  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "l(n) > n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.097, 0.496, 0.881, 0.515], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 对所有的概率多项式时间的区分器 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 来说, 存在一个可忽略函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathrm{neg} l"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 满足"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.247, 0.523, 0.725, 0.543], "content": "\\mid p (D (r) = 1) - p (D (G (s)) = 1) \\mid \\leqslant \\mathrm{neg} l (n)"}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.051, 0.551, 0.921, 0.599], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "式中，"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是从 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\{0,1\\}^{l(n)}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中均匀随机选择的，种子 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "s"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是从 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\{0,1\\}^n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中均匀随机选择的，并且概率来源为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的随机性和对 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r, s"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的选择。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.051, 0.607, 0.923, 0.737], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "现在可以利用伪随机发生器去构造一个定长的加密方案,该方案在有窃听者存在的情况下,具有不可区分性。这里构造的加密方案与“一次一密”加密方案很相似,除了这里使用的是一个伪随机字符串而不是一个随机字符串作为填充,由于一个伪随机字符串对任何多项式时间敌手来说看起来随机,故该加密方案能被证明是计算安全的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.052, 0.745, 0.923, 0.82], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "令 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个扩展因子为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "l"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的伪随机发生器。加密方案被三个算法定义:一个密钥生成算法 Gen，加密算法 Enc 及解密算法 Dec。加密过程是，密钥应用到一个伪随机发生器来获得一个长的填充，然后与明文消息作异或处理。具体构造方案如下。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.054, 0.828, 0.923, 0.875], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "令 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个扩展因子为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "l"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的伪随机发生器。定义一个消息长度为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "l"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的对称密钥加密方案如下:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.098, 0.884, 0.763, 0.902], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) Gen: 输入 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1^{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 均匀随机选择 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k \\leftarrow \\{0, 1\\}^{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 并将其作为密钥输出。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.099, 0.912, 0.797, 0.931], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) Enc: 输入一个密钥 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k \\in \\{0,1\\}^n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，以及消息 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m \\in \\{0,1\\}^{l(n)}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，输出密文"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 230, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.08, 0.055, 0.118, 0.068], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "218"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.4, 0.054, 0.562, 0.069], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.398, 0.089, 0.564, 0.106], "content": "c := G (k) \\oplus m"}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.091, 0.115, 0.814, 0.134], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(3) 输入一个密钥 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k \\in \\{0,1\\}^n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，以及一个密文 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c \\in \\{0,1\\}^{l(n)}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，输出明文消息"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.397, 0.143, 0.564, 0.161], "content": "m := G (k) \\oplus c"}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.047, 0.17, 0.915, 0.215], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "可以证明,在窃听者存在的情况下,若假设 G 是伪随机发生器,则给定的加密方案具备不可区分性。"}]}, {"type": "image", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.049, 0.231, 0.113, 0.273], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.049, 0.231, 0.113, 0.273], "content": ""}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.114, 0.256, 0.206, 0.277], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "习题五"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.092, 0.292, 0.862, 0.324], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1. 证明 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "7n^{5} + n^{2} - 3n = \\Theta(n^{5}), 7n^{3} + n^{2} - 3n = O(n^{5}), \\frac{1}{5} n^{3} + n^{2} - 3n = \\Omega(n^{5})"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.092, 0.336, 0.274, 0.352], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2. 证明下列结论:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.119, 0.363, 0.603, 0.38], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) 若  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n)=\\Theta(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，那么  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "g(n)=\\Theta(f(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.12, 0.39, 0.79, 0.407], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 若 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n) = O(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "g(n) = O(h(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，那么 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n) = O(h(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.12, 0.417, 0.644, 0.435], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(3) 若 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(n) = O(g(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 当且仅当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "g(n) = \\Omega(f(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.121, 0.444, 0.581, 0.462], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(4) "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(f(n) + g(n)) = O(\\max \\{f(n), g(n)\\})"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.092, 0.471, 0.714, 0.489], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "3. 对于表 5.1 中的图灵机, 给出输入串是 01010 时的格局序列。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.049, 0.499, 0.915, 0.543], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4. 设计一台多带确定性图灵机, 给它两个二进制正整数时, 由它计算出这两个数的积。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.049, 0.553, 0.916, 0.597], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5. 证明一台多带确定性图灵机能由一台单带确定性图灵机模拟,而且两者之间的时间复杂性是多项式相关的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.093, 0.607, 0.475, 0.625], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "6. 证明哈密顿回路问题是 NP 完全的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.093, 0.635, 0.43, 0.652], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "7. 证明子集和问题是 NP 完全的。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.051, 0.674, 0.161, 0.694], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "参考文献"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "ref_text", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.084, 0.715, 0.702, 0.731], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "[1] 姜新文, 彭立宏, 殷建平. 算法设计与分析. 长沙: 国防科技大学出版社, 2008."}]}, {"type": "ref_text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.085, 0.738, 0.653, 0.754], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "[2] 覃中平, 张焕国, 等. 信息安全数学基础. 北京: 清华大学出版社, 2006."}]}, {"type": "ref_text", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.085, 0.762, 0.864, 0.777], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "[3] 陈志平, 徐宗本. 计算机数学——计算复杂性理论与 NPC、NP 难问题的求解. 北京: 科学出版社, 2005."}]}, {"type": "ref_text", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.086, 0.785, 0.861, 0.801], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "[4] 乔纳森·卡茨，耶胡达·林德尔. 现代密码学——原理与协议. 任伟，译. 北京:国防工业出版，2012."}]}, {"type": "ref_text", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.086, 0.809, 0.652, 0.825], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "[5] 顾小丰, 孙世新, 卢光辉. 计算机复杂性. 北京: 机械工业出版社, 2005."}]}, {"type": "ref_text", "index": 25, "bbox": [0.086, 0.833, 0.601, 0.848], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "[6] 唐世伟, 刘贤梅. 信息论. 哈尔滨: 哈尔滨工程大学出版社, 2009."}]}, {"type": "ref_text", "index": 26, "bbox": [0.087, 0.856, 0.826, 0.872], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "[7] Thomas H Cormen, Charles E Leiserson, 等. 算法导论(第二版). 北京: 机械工业出版社, 2008."}]}, {"type": "ref_text", "index": 27, "bbox": [0.087, 0.88, 0.729, 0.895], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "[8] H S Wilf. Fundamentals of Computer Algorithms. Computer Science Press, 1978."}]}]}, {"page_idx": 231, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title